  "description": "Furry Summer Mexico (FSM) was a furry convention in Mexico City, founded in 2014 and organized by CMFur, with YXM (Wayexem Black Tiger) and Charley Wong among its organizers and the CMFur community as part of the staff. It began as an extended furmeet with no fixed location and was held at the Centro de Espectaculos Plaza in Cuauhtémoc from 2015 to 2017, when it moved to Ponciano Arriaga #20.",
